    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-canon-oldenborn-furrykin=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>\"Yesod fell. The world remembered old names. You answered.\"</em></p><p>Your place-soul is a weather front. You are the caravan memory of every tribe that crossed the ash squalls and came out the other side. When you walk, the wind remembers that you used to be the reason it had a name.</p><p><strong>Heritage signature (1/Soma Break).</strong> Surfaces the Stormborn Nomad Tier-I Wind-Read reaction (energy lightning/cold or kinetic electrical damage halved) directly from the heritage card. See the Tier-I feat for full mechanics.</p>\n<div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"oldStormbornNomadHeritage\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Stormborn Nomad Heritage</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Soma Break &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Reaction (mirrors Wind-Read) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">Heritage card surfaces Wind-Read (Tier-I): halve incoming lightning/cold/electrical damage as a reaction.</div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
